<title>JAPAN: Nakabayashi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nakabayashi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.05		vs	   18.90</p>
<p> Operating	  855    million	  vs	  879    million</p>
<p> Current	    609    million	  vs	  635    million</p>
<p> Net		  401    million	  vs	  234    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.36 yen	  vs	    3.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     63 million	  vs	  63 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.75 yen	  vs	    4.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nakabayashi Co Ltd is involved in bookbinding and paper products.</p>
</text>
